{"change_summary":"Implemented both pending amendments for the alkalinity-coupling bead. In `nitrogen_cycle.rs`, the shared alkalinity running budget now updates after the comammox debit and becomes the authoritative final pool commit, so future guilds inserted between comammox and the final write will see the correct remaining budget. In `process.rs`, I centralized `MG_N_PER_MEQ_AMMONIA` alongside the nitrification and denitrification stoichiometry constants, re-exported it from `types/mod.rs`, and switched `microfauna.rs` and `shrimp.rs` to consume the shared constant so the NH4+/alkalinity conversion cannot drift across systems.","outstanding_risks":["`alkalinity_produced_meq` remains a zero-valued placeholder until denitrification work lands; the bookkeeping surface is ready, but the return path is not implemented yet.","`cargo test -p tank_core --tests` still reproduces the pre-existing `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` failure in `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs:368`; that save/load determinism issue remains unresolved and is out of scope for this bead."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the pending amendments in `nitrogen_cycle.rs`, `process.rs`, `microfauna.rs`, and `shrimp.rs` to confirm the stale running-budget path and duplicated ammonia-to-alkalinity constant usage.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Patch the nitrogen-cycle alkalinity bookkeeping so comammox updates the shared running budget through the final alkalinity commit, and centralize `MG_N_PER_MEQ_AMMONIA` in `process.rs` with downstream imports updated to the shared export.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Run formatting and focused plus broader tank_core validation to confirm the amended bookkeeping and shared stoichiometry constant compile and behave as expected.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test nitrification_alkalinity` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` passed, including the shrimp unit tests that exercise the shared `MG_N_PER_MEQ_AMMONIA` constant.","`cargo test -p tank_core --tests` was rerun; all touched alkalinity, chemistry, cycling, shrimp, and microfauna surfaces passed, and the suite still ended on the pre-existing `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` failure in `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs:368`."]}